SUMMARY:Pro Jam with Special Guest Craig Caffall
DESCRIPTION:Bay Area singer/songwriter/guitarist Craig Caffall brings his special brand of blues to The California\nPro Jam welcomes Bay Area singer/songwriter/guitarist Craig Caffall\, who has worked with multiple artists including Bo Diddley\, John Mayall\, Martha Davis and the Motels\, David Clayton Thomas\, The Neville Brothers\, Lee Oskar\, Dan Hicks\, Bonnie Raitt\, Bob Wier\, and Steve Earle. He’s toured with Shana Morrison and played guitar with legendary singer Maria Muldaur\, touring with Maria throughout the United States\, Canada\, Mexico\, England\, Ireland\, Czech Republic\, Switzerland and Japan.\nDoors open at 5pm Show Starts at 6pm. Tickets $15 online. $18 at door. $12 for members.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/pro-jam-with-special-guest-craig-caffall/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Caffall.jpg
