SUMMARY:Earth Day with Erica Ambrin at Rio Nido Roadhouse
DESCRIPTION:🌎✨ Earth Day at the Roadhouse ✨🌎 \n  \nErica Ambrin is a soulful singer-songwriter whose sound blends folk\, indie\, and Americana with raw emotional storytelling. Known for her rich\, expressive vocals and intimate stage presence\, Erica’s music explores themes of connection\, nature\, and personal transformation—making her a perfect fit for an Earth Day celebration. Her performances feel both grounding and expansive\, weaving together heartfelt lyrics and melodic depth that stay with you long after the last note. \nJoin us at the Roadhouse for an evening of live music\, community\, and Earth-loving vibes \n 
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/earth-day-with-erica-ambrin-at-rio-nido-roadhouse/
