SUMMARY:Earth Day BioBlitz
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Earth Day with a Bioblitz on the Santa Rosa Southeast Greenway. We’ll start off the day with an orientation on how to use the iNaturalist app. Then feel free to wander the Southeast Greenway and take photos documenting all the nature you find! Meet on Franquette Ave at the southeast corner of Montgomery High School property. \nJoin Sonoma Land Trust and Ag + Open Space for Earth Day! \nThe Santa Rosa Southeast Greenway was protected in 2024 by Ag + Open Space for recreation and preservation of its natural resources. There is no charge for this event\, which is made possible by the voters of Sonoma County who fund the work of Ag + Open Space with a quarter-cent sales tax.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/earth-day-bioblitz/
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Southeast Greenway\, Franquette Ave & Mayette Ave\, Santa Rosa\, 95405
CATEGORIES:Holiday,Kids and Family,Recreation
END:VEVENT
