SUMMARY:Crooked Comedy with Nina G & More!
DESCRIPTION:LOL 707 COMEDY @ Crooked Goat Brew is Back! Farm to Funny Hometown Laughs in Petaluma \nHey 707!! 🎤 CROOKED COMEDY @crookedgoatbrewing is Baaaack for our 1st show of 2026! -— APRIL 23 !!!\nwith Special Guest and Headliner: \n✨ Nina G!!!\nNina G is a comedian\, author\, and professional speaker known for her sharp wit and advocacy. She’s the author of Stutterer Interrupted and Bay Area Stand-Up Comedy: A Humorous History\, and released her debut special Stutterer Interrupted in 2024. Nina has been featured in Variety\, NPR\, BBC\, TEDx\, KQED\, and more\, and is a sought-after headliner and keynote speaker.\n+++++ Features:\n🔥 Lester Ransom\n💥 Mean Dave \n🎙 Hosted by\nBeastie Bryce Williams (LOL 707) \n🚪 Doors 7PM\n🎬 Show 8PM \n🎟 $15 Presale / $20 Door \n🍺 Great beer • Private Room! Big laughs
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/crooked-comedy-with-nina-g-more/
